  - id: 13-flag-left-cloth
    layer: '13 Flag left cloth'
    shows: 'the left red hanging banner of the hall''s ceiling (painted red cloth, no emblem)'
    x: 786
    y: 0
    width: 70
    height: 204
    order: 60
    variants:
    - id: egypt
      when: 'culture=egypt'
      priority: 10
      alternates: 1
      describes: 'The left hanging banner in the leading culture''s colours with its emblem centred in the upper third for Egypt: winged sun disc, lotus and papyrus borders, lapis blue and gold; emblem WingedSun, colours #1C4E80 / #C8962E'
    - id: iraq
      when: 'culture=iraq'
      priority: 10
      alternates: 1
      describes: 'The left hanging banner in the leading culture''s colours with its emblem centred in the upper third for Iraq: eight-pointed star of Ishtar, glazed-brick blue with gold lions-gate stepped border; emblem Octastar, colours #1B4F72 / #D4A017'
    - id: greece
      when: 'culture=greece'
      priority: 10
      alternates: 1
      describes: 'The left hanging banner in the leading culture''s colours with its emblem centred in the upper third for Greece: laurel wreath, meander (Greek key) border, white and Aegean blue; emblem Laurel, colours #0D5EAF / #1F6F8B'
    - id: italy
      when: 'culture=italy'
      priority: 10
      alternates: 1
      describes: 'The left hanging banner in the leading culture''s colours with its emblem centred in the upper third for Italy: five-pointed star in a laurel ring, Roman civic arches, terracotta and olive green; emblem Star, colours #7A2E1F / #2E6B3F'
    - id: china
